  <item>
    <title>Oklahoma City: data center moratorium — Enacted</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/oklahoma-city-ok</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-oklahoma-city-ok</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>Emergency moratorium through end of 2026 on zoning and development applications for data centers, unanimous. Exempts 75 MW and below after a later amendment, plus two pending rezonings</description>
